; ============================================================================
; DR FORTRESS AI V13 FIX01
; Architecture reset: ResonanceBot 5-1c is the economic / civilian / age-up core.
; Fortress is a defensive, military and siege doctrine layered on top.
;
; IMPORTANT DESIGN RULES
; - Opening civilian tasking is intentionally left to ResonanceBot.
; - Dark -> Feudal -> Castle -> Imperial economy is intentionally ResonanceBot.
; - Fortress never enters a dedicated Castle-saving economy.
; - Castles are opportunistic high-value defensive anchors: build only when the
;   normal economy already makes one affordable and the placement has value.
; - Fortress adds fortification, threat memory, defensive formations, civ-aware
;   production, siege packages, recovery, concentrated counterattacks and
;   population profiles for 125 / 150 / 200.
;
; Original ResonanceBot code below remains attributed to @Resonance22.  V13 is a
; derived experimental AI for Age of Empires II HD, not the original bot.
; ============================================================================

;-------------------ResonanceBot AI was made by @Resonance22----------------------------
;-------------------http://www.youtube.com/Resonance22Channel---------------------------
;-------------------This AI plays only Random Map and requires 150 or more Pop---------
;-------------------Also requires Dark Age start and Standard/Low Resources!------------
;-------------------It is also capable of playing Regicide well-------------------------

;-------------------DO NOT MODIFY MY CODE IN ANY WAY! Thank you! ;)---------------------
;-------------------Changing any code will cause stability issues. Contact me first!----
;-------------------Request features in the Steam Discussions or on Twitter @Resonance22
;-------------------Requires Aoe2 HD Edition, aka Age of Empires II (2013) on Steam-----
;-------------------https://pastebin.com/M9VDcDZm Info, Difficulty, & Setup FAQ---------
;-------------------https://pastebin.com/gwumx3fV Full Development Changelog------------
